# Copy to .env. Only WXT_-prefixed vars reach the extension bundle.
# Never put a token or password here — the token is obtained at sign-in and
# lives only in chrome.storage.session (CONTRACTS §10.2).
#
# The CRM base: every route hangs off it —
#   POST {base}/auth/login          -> { token, expiry, user }
#   GET  {base}/user/me             -> the signed-in user
#   GET  {base}/lead | /student ... -> person lists
#   GET  {base}/immifill/*          -> payload, mappings, audit
# Verified live 2026-09-26: /auth/login exists and requires `email`.
WXT_CRM_BASE=https://api.successedu.com.au/success-crm

# The CRM is the only data source; there is no static/offline mode any more.
